<title>USA: Medex names Michael Barilla CFO, senior VP.</title>
<headline>Medex names Michael Barilla CFO, senior VP.</headline>
<dateline>HILLIARD, Ohio 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medex Inc said on Tuesday that Michael Barilla was named senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Barilla was previously vice president and acting chief financial officer and has been with the company for 13 years.</p>
</text>
